WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 63 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.240
So Seraphina's arrow didn't finish you.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.600
Let me guess.

3
00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:06.800
You sold your soul to the Forral Alpha to keep breathing.

4
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.240
The name Mordric Vein.

5
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:12.400
Every dragon knight will spit on it from now until the end of time.

6
00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:14.480
History is written by the victors.

7
00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:16.080
There's no right or wrong.

8
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.240
Only the living and the dead.

9
00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.480
Feral dragons don't grant favors for free.

10
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:21.520
What was the price?

11
00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:25.200
What is paid for inevitable success is not a price.

12
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:27.440
It's called a reasonable cost.

13
00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:42.990
What do you crawl into my domain to beg for?

14
00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:48.430
Save me and grant me dark magic, the most powerful you possess.

15
00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:51.710
When the deed is done, 10,000 living souls shall feed my swarm.

16
00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:55.310
Fail me and I will tear you apart before my hive devours your world.

17
00:00:56.670 --> 00:01:00.750
Done. Once I win, they're all yours.

18
00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:01.950
Down payment first.

19
00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:06.030
I'll take your soul and that little dragon of yours.

20
00:01:08.510 --> 00:01:10.510
You gave up your humanity for power.

21
00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:12.990
It's pathetic.

22
00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:18.670
Hippocrite, your family's traded a bedroll 20 years ago just to secure your power.

23
00:01:18.670 --> 00:01:19.950
Don't act so innocent.

24
00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:21.950
There's more to life than power, Mordrac.

25
00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:25.310
Seraphina and I, we chose each other. That's the difference.

26
00:01:26.030 --> 00:01:27.390
He will never understand.

27
00:01:28.030 --> 00:01:29.230
Weapons up, Arras.

28
00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:32.430
Then you shall be the appetizer for my swarm.
